# ============================================================
# PROJECT LOOP 2.0 — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' and fill in the values below.
# DO NOT commit '.env' or any live secrets to source control.

# ============================================================
# 1. DATABASE
# ============================================================
# Required for Prisma ORM.
#
# Development (Default):
# Uses local zero-friction SQLite database file (no external setup required):
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
#
# Production (Cloud / Vercel / Railway / Supabase / Neon):
# If deploying with PostgreSQL, use pooled connection for DATABASE_URL and direct/unpooled for DIRECT_URL:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://<user>:<password>@<host-pooler>:<port>/<database>?sslmode=require"
# DIRECT_URL="postgresql://<user>:<password>@<host-direct>:<port>/<database>?sslmode=require"

# ============================================================
# 2. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY (NextAuth.js v4)
# ============================================================
# Canonical application URL used for callback redirects and cookie domains.
# Local Development: http://localhost:3000
# Production: https://your-production-domain.com
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Cryptographically random string used to encrypt JWT session tokens.
# Must be at least 32 characters long.
# Generate on Linux/macOS/Git Bash via: openssl rand -base64 32
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="change-this-to-a-secure-random-32-char-string-in-production"

# ============================================================
# 3. AI / NLP INTELLIGENCE ENGINE (Optional)
# ============================================================
# Anthropic API Key for Claude 3.5 Sonnet cloud intelligence.
#
# Optional: If omitted or left empty, the platform automatically engages
# the built-in High-Precision Deterministic NLP Engine for 100% offline
# classification, ABSA, 8-emotion taxonomy, and severity calculation.
#
# Obtain from: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
